Package: perfcomparator-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, ca-certificates, curl | wget
Maintainer: PerfComparator <noreply@github.com>
Description: User-level installer and uninstaller for PerfComparator
 Installs uv, managed CPython with Tk, and PerfComparator for the current user.
 The application and its Python environment are not installed as root.
